    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893640/extras/429f52d37c1840763fd4bfc21c6de92e.avif?t=1729596497\" width=600 height=318 /></span><br><strong>Race for the Future</strong><br>Dive into the near future with Celeros, a high-octane racing experience where technology and sustainability converge to redefine competition. In a world where pilots and racers are celebrated as pioneers of progress, you'll take the wheel of cutting-edge vehicles that epitomize the harmony of speed, efficiency, and environmental stewardship. Celeros isn't just a game\u2014it's a vision of a future where the thrill of the race drives society towards a brighter, greener tomorrow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893640/extras/75860a2f49fe91cee00703047d53ca01.avif?t=1729596497\" width=600 height=73 /></span><br><strong>The Official Airspeeder Racing Game</strong><br>In Celeros, you seize control, customize, and race Airspeeders across authentic locations and tracks used in the world's first flying car racing series.<br><br><strong>Compete in a New Kind of Esport</strong><br>Celeros redefines the boundaries of competitive gaming with its rewarding gameplay, designed to celebrate precision, persistence, and risk-taking. <br><br><strong>Join the Race</strong><br>Are you ready to become the next champion of Celeros?",
